        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Lawn Mower Pro is the complete autonomous mowing system for large, demanding properties. It pairs the Yarbo Core, an intelligent tracked base with centimeter-accurate RTK navigation, with the Lawn Mower Pro Module for a wire-free, fully autonomous mowing solution that handles up to 6.2 acres.</p><p>Set your schedule once. The system maps your property, mows in precise lanes, returns to dock at 20% battery, recharges, and resumes exactly where it left off. No wires to bury, no crew to coordinate, no passes missed.</p><p>Built for real terrain: tracked drive, 70% slope climbing (35°), IPX5 weather resistance, and binocular camera plus ultrasonic radar for obstacle detection. This is not a toy-grade robot mower.</p><p>Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros. We match the right configuration to your property, walk you through setup, and stay available for the life of your machine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>The Autonomous Estate. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p><strong>The last lawn crew you'll ever hire runs itself.</strong></p><p>The Yarbo Lawn Mower Pro pairs the Yarbo Core, an intelligent tracked autonomous base, with the Lawn Mower Pro Module. Together they form a complete wire-free mowing system built for large, demanding properties up to 6.2 acres.</p><p><strong>Precision cutting, every pass</strong> Adaptive cutting height and precision blades adjust automatically to terrain changes, delivering a consistent, professional finish across open lawns, tight corners, and slopes up to 35°.</p><p><strong>Centimeter-accurate navigation, no wires</strong> RTK positioning, binocular vision, and multi-sensor fusion hold precise lines across your entire property, including under tree cover where GPS-only robots drift.</p><p><strong>Specifications</strong> System includes: Yarbo Core + Lawn Mower Pro Module. Cutting width: 20 in (500 mm). Cutting height: 0.8 to 4.0 in. Max coverage: 6.2 acres at 2x per week. Slope: 70% (35°). Navigation: RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM. Battery: 1500Wh, approximately 4 hour runtime, approximately 3 hour charge. Weather resistance: IPX5 with rain detection. Connectivity: 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow.</p><p><strong>Ownership, handled</strong> Typically delivered in about two weeks. Covered by Yarbo's 2-year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, from activation date. Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros, before and after the sale.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Yarbo’s standard 2 year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, beginning from the date your machine is activated. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Attaching the Lawn Mower Pro module to your Yarbo Core takes just a few minutes, no tools required. The Yarbo app guides you through calibration and setup. Compatible with iOS and Android.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
